[Computer Weekly] Controversial Fujitsu contract extension on the cards at Post Office — &lt;p&gt;Fujitsu is set to see its relationship with the Post Office extended further as it takes longer than anticipated to unwrap the controversial 30-year relationship.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Slower-than-expected progress transitioning from Fujitsu has cast doubt on whether the supplier’s contract end date, when Accenture was due to take over the running of Horizon, will be met.&lt;/p&gt; 
